| | Seed isolate (I1) | Tree `oodac build main.oo` (I9) |
|--|-------------------|----------------------------------|
| Emit host | pinned seed (6s secret) | 04:49 ELF — **hangs** on secret |
| `check main.oo` | **skipped** (R4 / `PURE_SKIP_CHECK=1`) | **deadlock / timeout** |
| Inputs | HEAD + 2 files | 11 dirty files + hang |
| 2.9 claim | depth-in-ELF, named riders | never gets an ELF |
| Hygiene | side path; no ELF commit | same, but never green |
| Ship this turn | **Yes** | **No** (proved) |

**Ship-now decision:** **seed-host isolate rebuild.**  
Tree self-rebuild is not a 2.9 close. It is the failed path.

